      {
        "id": 37732,
        "name": "World Court Tennis",
        "summary": "It's your serve. WHOP! The ball clears the net at 100 MPH and raises a little dust just inside the chalkline. An ace? no. WHOP! Your opponent returns with a powerful backhand that kills your plan of charging the net. No matter how you play - with up to 3 friends, singles, doubles, or against the computer - World Court Tennis will tax your endurance and test your skill with action that's fast and furious. Just don't scream at the line judge. He's never wrong.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co6xqk.jpg",
