      {
        "id": 38095,
        "name": "Ankoku Densetsu",
        "summary": "Ankoku Densetsu ('Dark Legend') is widely considered to be the follow-up to the PC Engine classic Makyo Densetsu (1988) ('The Legendary Axe').",
