      {
        "id": 42097,
        "name": "Bomberman '93",
        "summary": "Tension, strategy, action, excitement - Bomberman's back!\n\nYou can now battle against up to four computer-controlled maniacs by yourself for the ultimate five bomberman mode.\nChoose from seven exciting new stages with loads of new power-up items like werps, conveyer belts, revolving doors and even kicking bombs!\nOr for portable thrills, go head-to-head against a friend using TurboExpress for non-stop action.\nThe best competitive game is back, and it's more intense than ever!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co685w.jpg",
